  "justification": "TVDB 73820 is gone; the franchise was folded into TVDB 72172 MegaMan: NT Warrior (TMDB 5653; it lists AniDB 1143), where Axess is season 2, episodes 1-51 from 2003-10-04 to 2004-09-25 as on AniDB: 1 Cross Fusion!, 2 NetCity No More! (Net City Shoumetsu!), 9 Dex Returns!, 14 The Purloined Princess!, 29 Chaud VS ProtoMan, 42 Maylu's First Date, 50 Dark vs Dark. AniDB special S1 Rockman.EXE Digest (2004-04-07) is season 0 episode 2 MegaMan NT Warrior - Digest (2004-04-07); its default was episode 1, the 2005 film. TMDB 5653 season 2 is Axess (51 episodes from CrossFusion, 2003-10-04), so tmdbseason goes from 1 to 2; TMDB 5653 has no season 0, so the digest is unmapped there instead of defaulting onto the episode node 2912 claims.",
